      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but everything feels so fake. like i'm just pretending to be a person so i don't make others uncomfortable. seeing everyone else out there living their lives, achieving stuff, and me just... existing? it's exhausting. it feels like the world moved on without me and i'm just a glitch in the system that hasn't been fixed yet.",
